From 37d88cc995d1cf8639be622702c5daa3dc06f490 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:30:44 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] web: a box around the flare on the disk, the Grad-CAM and the
 4 channels

From the region's bounding box (Centella >= 2.5 bbox_arcsec; area as a
fallback) plus 30" a side, at least 160", server-rendered and redrawn by
flare-page.js for each instant (the open event's location during decay).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019TiLZJK6V4V5hFsgBRSyAK
